kelivo-fusion
=============

A merge of two upstream projects with MIT components, distributed under
AGPL-3.0 (see LICENSE). The full text of every license named below is kept in
third_party/, and this file covers the code merged into or fetched by the
application.

Merged upstreams

  kelivo      AGPL-3.0        https://github.com/Chevey339/kelivo
              third_party/kelivo/LICENSE

  Operit      LGPL-3.0-only   https://github.com/AAswordman/Operit
              third_party/operit/LICENSE

Components

  QuickJS     MIT             not vendored: android/operit_quickjs/src/main/cpp/
                              CMakeLists.txt fetches it at build time through
                              operit_prepare_git_source() from
                              https://github.com/bellard/quickjs.git (ref master)
              Copyright (c) 2017-2021 Fabrice Bellard
              Copyright (c) 2017-2021 Charlie Gordon
              third_party/quickjs/LICENSE

  hjson       MIT             Maven: org.hjson:hjson:3.0.0
              Copyright (c) 2013, 2014 EclipseSource
